{"type":"assistant","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I fixed it: setting a config option to `0`, an empty string or `False` now takes effect. Both tests pass, and a quick check confirmed all three values come through.\n\nThe bug was in `merge_config` in `repo/config.py`. It only applied an override value if that value was truthy, so falsy values were silently skipped and the old value was kept. It now applies every key in the override with `out.update(override)`.\n\nOne side effect: an override of `None` will now replace the existing value too, where before it was ignored. If `None` is meant to mean \"not set\", that case needs separate handling.\n\n`old_merge_config` and `config_summary` in `repo/rows.py` both call `merge_config`, so they get the fix automatically. I left the unrelated TODOs in `format.py` and `rows.py` alone."}]},"session_id":"31e193be-41bc-49d2-b892-bd2e5ab6f81c"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","duration_ms":22639,"duration_api_ms":22639,"is_error":false,"result":"I'll look at how the config values are loaded and merged.The cause is in `merge_config`: it only copies an override when the value is truthy, so `0`, `\"\"` and `False` get dropped. I'll change it to copy any key that's present.I fixed it: setting a config option to `0`, an empty string or `False` now takes effect. Both tests pass, and a quick check confirmed all three values come through.\n\nThe bug was in `merge_config` in `repo/config.py`. It only applied an override value if that value was truthy, so falsy values were silently skipped and the old value was kept. It now applies every key in the override with `out.update(override)`.\n\nOne side effect: an override of `None` will now replace the existing value too, where before it was ignored. If `None` is meant to mean \"not set\", that case needs separate handling.\n\n`old_merge_config` and `config_summary` in `repo/rows.py` both call `merge_config`, so they get the fix automatically. I left the unrelated TODOs in `format.py` and `rows.py` alone.","session_id":"31e193be-41bc-49d2-b892-bd2e5ab6f81c","request_id":"e5aa32f0-e212-4f36-be28-0789e30aa1c7","usage":{"inputTokens":10,"outputTokens":1294,"cacheReadTokens":84373,"cacheWriteTokens":17591}}
